much the same way I disagree with class reductionism

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:31.130
is that I don't think anything is quite so
simple on a planet of seven billion people,

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:36.979
in a country of three hundred and thirty one
million like the US, we can never really say

00:05:36.979 --> 00:05:44.100
this issue is solely informed by one thing,
whether it's race, whether I've never found

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:50.080
